{"module":"afro-latino","voice":"female","duration":291.0,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"La diáspora africana en América Latina y el Caribe","start":0.0,"end":4.33,"words":[[0.08,0.28],[0.28,1.08],[1.08,1.88],[1.88,2.08],[2.08,2.79],[2.79,3.39],[3.39,3.49],[3.49,3.69],[3.69,4.29]]},{"el":"intro","text":"EE. UU. recibió solo una pequeña parte de los africanos llevados a través del Atlántico.","start":5.13,"end":11.5,"words":[[5.22,5.44],[5.79,6.01],[6.37,6.87],[6.87,7.15],[7.15,7.37],[7.37,7.8],[7.8,8.15],[8.15,8.3],[8.3,8.51],[8.51,9.16],[9.16,9.66],[9.66,9.73],[9.73,10.16],[10.16,10.37],[10.37,11.09]]},{"el":"intro","text":"La mayoría fue a Brasil y al Caribe, y sus descendientes viven en todo el continente, incluidos millones de afrolatinos en Estados Unidos.","start":11.85,"end":21.03,"words":[[11.94,12.09],[12.09,12.65],[12.65,12.86],[12.86,12.93],[12.93,13.36],[13.36,13.43],[13.43,13.57],[13.57,14.06],[14.31,14.38],[14.38,14.59],[14.59,15.44],[15.44,15.79],[15.79,15.93],[15.93,16.22],[16.22,16.36],[16.36,17.13],[17.38,18.02],[18.02,18.58],[18.58,18.72],[18.72,19.5],[19.5,19.64],[19.64,20.14],[20.14,20.63]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Allí el racismo tomó otras formas, pero no fue menos real.","start":21.38,"end":26.23,"words":[[21.51,21.84],[21.84,22.0],[22.0,22.58],[22.58,22.91],[22.91,23.33],[23.33,23.91],[24.2,24.53],[24.53,24.69],[24.69,24.94],[24.94,25.36],[25.36,25.77]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Adónde iban los barcos","start":26.58,"end":28.45,"words":[[26.66,27.2],[27.2,27.56],[27.56,27.83],[27.83,28.37]]},{"el":"s0","text":"De los cerca de 10.7 millones de africanos que sobrevivieron a la travesía del Atlántico, unos 388,000 fueron llevados directamente a Norteamérica continental.","start":29.15,"end":41.61,"words":[[29.26,29.39],[29.39,29.59],[29.59,29.91],[29.91,30.04],[30.04,30.96],[30.96,31.49],[31.49,31.62],[31.62,32.21],[32.21,32.34],[32.34,33.19],[33.19,33.26],[33.26,33.39],[33.39,33.98],[33.98,34.18],[34.18,34.83],[35.06,35.32],[35.32,37.94],[37.94,38.34],[38.34,38.8],[38.8,39.58],[39.58,39.65],[39.65,40.44],[40.44,41.22]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Unos 4.9 millones fueron llevados a Brasil, y la mayoría del resto al Caribe y a la América española (SlaveVoyages.org).","start":41.96,"end":51.1,"words":[[42.04,42.32],[42.32,43.47],[43.47,44.04],[44.04,44.47],[44.47,44.98],[44.98,45.05],[45.05,45.55],[45.8,45.87],[45.87,46.02],[46.02,46.59],[46.59,46.81],[46.81,47.16],[47.16,47.31],[47.31,47.74],[47.74,47.81],[47.81,47.88],[47.88,48.02],[48.02,48.53],[48.53,49.1],[49.1,50.61]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Haití y la República Dominicana","start":52.0,"end":54.77,"words":[[52.12,52.52],[52.52,52.62],[52.62,52.82],[52.82,53.72],[53.72,54.72]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Haití ganó su independencia en 1804 y fue castigado por ello (ver “Antes de la raza”).","start":55.47,"end":61.77,"words":[[55.59,55.87],[55.87,56.15],[56.15,56.29],[56.29,57.2],[57.2,57.35],[57.35,58.75],[58.75,58.82],[58.82,59.03],[59.03,59.66],[59.66,59.88],[59.88,60.16],[60.16,60.37],[60.37,60.72],[60.72,60.86],[60.86,61.0],[61.0,61.35]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En octubre de 1937, el dictador dominicano Rafael Trujillo ordenó a sus soldados matar a haitianos y a dominicanos de ascendencia haitiana en la zona fronteriza; las estimaciones de muertos van de unos 12,000 a 30,000.","start":62.12,"end":79.22,"words":[[62.19,62.33],[62.33,62.81],[62.81,62.95],[62.95,64.89],[65.13,65.27],[65.27,65.82],[65.82,66.51],[66.51,66.92],[66.92,67.48],[67.48,67.89],[67.89,67.96],[67.96,68.17],[68.17,68.72],[68.72,69.06],[69.06,69.13],[69.13,69.69],[69.69,69.76],[69.76,69.82],[69.82,70.58],[70.58,70.72],[70.72,71.41],[71.41,71.9],[71.9,72.03],[72.03,72.17],[72.17,72.45],[72.45,73.21],[73.45,73.66],[73.66,74.49],[74.49,74.62],[74.62,75.11],[75.11,75.32],[75.32,75.45],[75.45,75.73],[75.73,77.11],[77.11,77.18],[77.18,78.84]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Se recuerda como la masacre del Perejil.","start":79.57,"end":82.01,"words":[[79.64,79.76],[79.76,80.24],[80.24,80.48],[80.48,80.6],[80.6,81.02],[81.02,81.2],[81.2,81.68]]},{"el":"s1","text":"En 2013, el Tribunal Constitucional dominicano dictaminó que los hijos de padres extranjeros indocumentados nacidos en el país desde 1929 no eran ciudadanos, lo que dejó sin nacionalidad a decenas de miles de dominicanos de ascendencia haitiana.","start":82.36,"end":98.96,"words":[[82.44,82.58],[82.58,83.38],[83.62,83.75],[83.75,84.29],[84.29,85.23],[85.23,85.9],[85.9,86.51],[86.51,86.64],[86.64,86.85],[86.85,87.11],[87.11,87.25],[87.25,87.65],[87.65,88.46],[88.46,89.4],[89.4,89.87],[89.87,90.01],[90.01,90.14],[90.14,90.41],[90.41,90.74],[90.74,92.43],[92.43,92.56],[92.56,92.83],[92.83,93.57],[93.8,93.94],[93.94,94.07],[94.07,94.34],[94.34,94.54],[94.54,95.35],[95.35,95.42],[95.42,95.89],[95.89,96.02],[96.02,96.36],[96.36,96.49],[96.49,97.23],[97.23,97.37],[97.37,98.04],[98.04,98.58]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Cuba y Puerto Rico","start":99.86,"end":101.63,"words":[[99.98,100.41],[100.41,100.52],[100.52,101.17],[101.17,101.6]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Veteranos afrocubanos de la guerra de independencia fundaron el Partido Independiente de Color en 1908.","start":102.33,"end":109.67,"words":[[102.41,103.02],[103.02,103.77],[103.77,103.9],[103.9,104.04],[104.04,104.31],[104.31,104.45],[104.45,105.33],[105.33,105.87],[105.87,106.01],[106.01,106.49],[106.49,107.37],[107.37,107.51],[107.51,107.85],[107.85,107.98],[107.98,109.27]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Cuba prohibió en 1910 los partidos organizados por raza, y en 1912 el ejército aplastó la protesta del partido, matando a entre 2,000 y 6,000 afrocubanos, según las estimaciones.","start":110.02,"end":126.37,"words":[[110.11,110.4],[110.4,110.91],[110.91,111.06],[111.06,112.38],[112.38,112.6],[112.6,113.18],[113.18,113.99],[113.99,114.21],[114.21,114.57],[114.83,114.9],[114.9,115.05],[115.05,116.37],[116.37,116.51],[116.51,117.1],[117.1,117.61],[117.61,117.76],[117.76,118.35],[118.35,118.57],[118.57,119.15],[119.41,119.92],[119.92,119.99],[119.99,120.36],[120.36,121.75],[121.75,121.82],[121.82,123.29],[123.29,124.17],[124.42,124.79],[124.79,125.01],[125.01,125.96]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Puerto Rico abolió la esclavitud en 1873.","start":126.72,"end":130.99,"words":[[126.81,127.21],[127.21,127.48],[127.48,127.88],[127.88,128.01],[128.01,128.67],[128.67,128.8],[128.8,130.59]]},{"el":"s2","text":"El puertorriqueño Arturo Schomburg dedicó su vida a reunir libros y documentos de historia negra; su colección es el núcleo del Centro Schomburg para la Investigación de la Cultura Negra de la Biblioteca Pública de Nueva York.","start":131.34,"end":145.51,"words":[[131.4,131.54],[131.54,132.4],[132.4,132.83],[132.83,133.47],[133.47,133.9],[133.9,134.04],[134.04,134.33],[134.33,134.4],[134.4,134.83],[134.83,135.26],[135.26,135.33],[135.33,136.05],[136.05,136.19],[136.19,136.69],[136.69,137.12],[137.37,137.51],[137.51,138.16],[138.16,138.3],[138.3,138.44],[138.44,138.87],[138.87,139.09],[139.09,139.52],[139.52,140.16],[140.16,140.45],[140.45,140.59],[140.59,141.52],[141.52,141.66],[141.66,141.8],[141.8,142.31],[142.31,142.66],[142.66,142.81],[142.81,142.95],[142.95,143.74],[143.74,144.24],[144.24,144.38],[144.38,144.74],[144.74,145.1]]},{"el":"h3","text":"México y Centroamérica","start":146.41,"end":148.35,"words":[[146.5,147.05],[147.05,147.14],[147.14,148.32]]},{"el":"s3","text":"A principios del siglo XVII, Gaspar Yanga encabezó una comunidad de personas que habían escapado de la esclavitud cerca de Veracruz y resistió a las tropas españolas; España aceptó reconocer un pueblo libre, que hoy se llama Yanga.","start":149.05,"end":164.36,"words":[[149.14,149.21],[149.21,149.93],[149.93,150.14],[150.14,150.5],[150.5,151.29],[151.54,151.97],[151.97,152.33],[152.33,152.9],[152.9,153.11],[153.11,153.76],[153.76,153.9],[153.9,154.47],[154.47,154.62],[154.62,155.05],[155.05,155.62],[155.62,155.76],[155.76,155.91],[155.91,156.62],[156.62,156.98],[156.98,157.12],[157.12,157.7],[157.7,157.77],[157.77,158.34],[158.34,158.41],[158.41,158.63],[158.63,159.06],[159.06,159.77],[160.02,160.45],[160.45,160.88],[160.88,161.53],[161.53,161.67],[161.67,162.1],[162.1,162.53],[162.78,162.92],[162.92,163.07],[163.07,163.21],[163.21,163.5],[163.5,163.93]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Vicente Guerrero, un presidente de ascendencia africana e indígena, abolió la esclavitud en México en 1829, y miles de personas esclavizadas en Texas y el sur de EE. UU. huyeron hacia el sur en busca de libertad.","start":164.71,"end":180.71,"words":[[164.8,165.31],[165.31,165.82],[166.07,166.22],[166.22,166.95],[166.95,167.09],[167.09,167.82],[167.82,168.4],[168.4,168.47],[168.47,169.12],[169.38,169.81],[169.81,169.96],[169.96,170.68],[170.68,170.83],[170.83,171.27],[171.27,171.41],[171.41,173.3],[173.55,173.62],[173.62,173.99],[173.99,174.13],[174.13,174.71],[174.71,175.59],[175.59,175.73],[175.73,176.17],[176.17,176.24],[176.24,176.38],[176.38,176.6],[176.6,176.75],[176.75,176.96],[177.33,177.55],[177.91,178.34],[178.34,178.63],[178.63,178.78],[178.78,179.0],[179.0,179.14],[179.14,179.51],[179.51,179.65],[179.65,180.3]]},{"el":"s3","text":"México contó por primera vez a su población afromexicana en 2015 (cerca de 1.4 millones de personas) y la reconoció en la constitución en 2019.","start":181.06,"end":192.66,"words":[[181.15,181.59],[181.59,181.96],[181.96,182.18],[182.18,182.7],[182.7,182.92],[182.92,182.99],[182.99,183.14],[183.14,183.8],[183.8,184.69],[184.69,184.83],[184.83,185.65],[185.65,186.01],[186.01,186.16],[186.16,187.19],[187.19,187.78],[187.78,187.93],[187.93,188.52],[188.78,188.85],[188.85,189.0],[189.0,189.66],[189.66,189.81],[189.81,189.95],[189.95,190.84],[190.84,190.99],[190.99,192.24]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Los garífunas, descendientes de africanos e indígenas caribeños, viven en las costas de Honduras, Belice, Guatemala y Nicaragua.","start":193.01,"end":202.22,"words":[[193.12,193.33],[193.33,194.04],[194.29,195.13],[195.13,195.27],[195.27,195.91],[195.91,195.98],[195.98,196.62],[196.62,197.32],[197.57,197.92],[197.92,198.06],[198.06,198.28],[198.28,198.7],[198.7,198.84],[198.84,199.41],[199.65,200.15],[200.39,201.03],[201.03,201.1],[201.1,201.81]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Brasil y el mito de la “democracia racial”","start":203.12,"end":205.72,"words":[[203.19,203.64],[203.64,203.72],[203.72,203.87],[203.87,204.17],[204.17,204.32],[204.32,204.47],[204.47,205.23],[205.23,205.68]]},{"el":"s4","text":"En la década de 1930, el sociólogo Gilberto Freyre popularizó la idea de que Brasil, a diferencia de EE. UU., era una “democracia racial” donde el mestizaje había borrado el racismo.","start":206.42,"end":219.11,"words":[[206.54,206.67],[206.67,206.81],[206.81,207.22],[207.22,207.35],[207.35,208.85],[209.08,209.22],[209.22,209.83],[209.83,210.37],[210.37,210.78],[210.78,211.46],[211.46,211.59],[211.59,211.87],[211.87,212.0],[212.0,212.14],[212.14,212.61],[212.85,212.92],[212.92,213.6],[213.6,213.73],[213.73,213.94],[214.27,214.48],[214.72,214.92],[214.92,215.12],[215.12,215.8],[215.8,216.21],[216.21,216.55],[216.55,216.68],[216.68,217.29],[217.29,217.63],[217.63,218.04],[218.04,218.18],[218.18,218.72]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El registro lo contradice.","start":219.46,"end":221.32,"words":[[219.59,219.71],[219.71,220.19],[220.19,220.31],[220.31,220.96]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Brasil fue el último país de América en abolir la esclavitud (1888), y después el gobierno subsidió la inmigración europea en un esfuerzo deliberado por “blanquear” la población.","start":221.67,"end":234.09,"words":[[221.73,222.14],[222.14,222.35],[222.35,222.49],[222.49,222.91],[222.91,223.18],[223.18,223.32],[223.32,223.81],[223.81,223.95],[223.95,224.36],[224.36,224.5],[224.5,225.2],[225.2,227.14],[227.38,227.45],[227.45,227.94],[227.94,228.08],[228.08,228.63],[228.63,229.19],[229.19,229.33],[229.33,230.09],[230.09,230.58],[230.58,230.71],[230.71,230.85],[230.85,231.41],[231.41,232.1],[232.1,232.31],[232.31,232.87],[232.87,233.01],[233.01,233.7]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Hoy la mayoría de los brasileños se identifica como negra o parda, pero siguen siendo mucho más pobres y mucho más propensos a morir a manos de la policía.","start":234.44,"end":244.41,"words":[[234.52,234.66],[234.66,234.81],[234.81,235.39],[235.39,235.53],[235.53,235.75],[235.75,236.47],[236.47,236.62],[236.62,237.34],[237.34,237.63],[237.63,238.0],[238.0,238.07],[238.07,238.5],[238.76,239.05],[239.05,239.41],[239.41,239.84],[239.84,240.21],[240.21,240.42],[240.42,240.86],[240.86,240.93],[240.93,241.29],[241.29,241.51],[241.51,242.16],[242.16,242.23],[242.23,242.6],[242.6,242.67],[242.67,243.03],[243.03,243.18],[243.18,243.32],[243.32,243.97]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Brasil adoptó cuotas raciales en sus universidades federales en 2012.","start":244.76,"end":249.8,"words":[[244.81,245.23],[245.23,245.64],[245.64,246.06],[246.06,246.62],[246.62,246.75],[246.75,246.96],[246.96,247.87],[247.87,248.49],[248.49,248.63],[248.63,249.39]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Afrolatinos en Estados Unidos","start":250.7,"end":252.82,"words":[[250.76,251.61],[251.61,251.77],[251.77,252.31],[252.31,252.77]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Una encuesta de 2022 del Pew Research Center encontró que cerca del 12% de los adultos latinos en EE. UU., unos 6 millones de personas, se identifican como afrolatinos.","start":253.52,"end":266.0,"words":[[253.62,253.83],[253.83,254.38],[254.38,254.52],[254.52,255.55],[255.55,255.76],[255.76,255.97],[255.97,256.52],[256.52,256.93],[256.93,257.48],[257.48,257.62],[257.62,257.96],[257.96,258.17],[258.17,259.07],[259.07,259.2],[259.2,259.41],[259.41,259.89],[259.89,260.38],[260.38,260.51],[260.51,260.72],[261.06,261.27],[261.51,261.79],[261.79,262.06],[262.06,262.61],[262.61,262.75],[262.75,263.37],[263.61,263.75],[263.75,264.51],[264.51,264.78],[264.78,265.61]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Muchos reportan discriminación tanto por ser negros como por ser latinos, incluso por parte de otros latinos.","start":266.35,"end":273.54,"words":[[266.41,266.83],[266.83,267.39],[267.39,268.37],[268.37,268.71],[268.71,268.92],[268.92,269.13],[269.13,269.55],[269.55,269.83],[269.83,270.04],[270.04,270.25],[270.25,270.81],[271.05,271.54],[271.54,271.75],[271.75,272.09],[272.09,272.23],[272.23,272.58],[272.58,273.14]]},{"el":"s5","text":"El colorismo, la preferencia por la piel más clara dentro de una comunidad, forma parte de esta historia en todo el continente.","start":273.89,"end":282.39,"words":[[274.0,274.14],[274.14,274.86],[275.1,275.25],[275.25,276.03],[276.03,276.24],[276.24,276.39],[276.39,276.67],[276.67,276.89],[276.89,277.24],[277.24,277.67],[277.67,277.81],[277.81,278.02],[278.02,278.74],[278.99,279.34],[279.34,279.7],[279.7,279.84],[279.84,280.12],[280.12,280.62],[280.62,280.77],[280.77,281.05],[281.05,281.19],[281.19,281.98]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La Ley CAREN protege a cualquier persona denunciada a la policía por su raza, color, ascendencia u origen nacional.","start":282.74,"end":290.11,"words":[[282.85,282.98],[282.98,283.18],[283.18,283.52],[283.52,283.99],[283.99,284.05],[284.05,284.59],[284.59,285.05],[285.05,285.72],[285.72,285.79],[285.79,285.92],[285.92,286.46],[286.46,286.66],[286.66,286.79],[286.79,287.12],[287.36,287.76],[287.99,288.66],[288.66,288.73],[288.73,289.13],[289.13,289.73]]}]}